            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow crecimiento"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow 成长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoveGrow is distributed as open-source software under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow is distributed as open-source software under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow se distribuye como software de código abierto bajo la Licencia Pública General Affero de GNU v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow 以开源软件形式发布，采用 GNU Affero 通用公共许可证 v3.0（AGPL-3.0）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoveGrow noticed these movement patterns on this iPhone. Watch the clip before adding one to your timeline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow noticed these movement patterns on this iPhone. Watch the clip before adding one to your timeline."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow detectó estos patrones de movimiento en este iPhone. Mira el fragmento antes de añadirlo a tu cronología."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow 在这台 iPhone 上发现了这些动作模式。添加到时间线之前，请先看看片段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoveGrow provides descriptive movement visualization and organization. It is not a developmental screening test, diagnosis or medical device." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow provides descriptive movement visualization and organization. It is not a developmental screening test, diagnosis or medical device."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow ofrece visualización y organización descriptivas del movimiento. No es una prueba de detección del desarrollo, ni un diagnóstico, ni un dispositivo médico."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow 提供描述性的动作可视化与整理，不是发育筛查测试、诊断工具或医疗器械。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoveGrow rebuilds each movement as a 3D figure and measures it on your baby’s own body, not on the flat picture. Straight above or a little to the side both work, as long as all four limbs stay in view." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow rebuilds each movement as a 3D figure and measures it on your baby’s own body, not on the flat picture. Straight above or a little to the side both work, as long as all four limbs stay in view."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow reconstruye cada movimiento como una figura en 3D y lo mide sobre el cuerpo de tu bebé, no sobre la imagen plana. Desde arriba o un poco de lado, las dos formas sirven, siempre que los brazos y las piernas se vean todo el tiempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MoveGrow 会把每个动作还原成 3D 形象，按宝宝自己的身体来量，而不是按平面画面来量。从正上方拍，或者稍微偏一点拍，都可以，只要四肢一直在画面内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
