    "Movement boundaries use experimental, adjustable thresholds. Small movements, occlusion and camera motion can affect results." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Movement boundaries use experimental, adjustable thresholds. Small movements, occlusion and camera motion can affect results."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los límites del movimiento usan umbrales experimentales y ajustables. Los movimientos pequeños, las partes tapadas y el movimiento de la cámara pueden afectar a los resultados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "动作的判定使用实验性的、可调整的阈值。细小动作、遮挡和镜头晃动都会影响结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Movement checks use corrected age (counted from the due date) until 24 months, as paediatric guidance does for babies born early." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Movement checks use corrected age (counted from the due date) until 24 months, as paediatric guidance does for babies born early."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta los 24 meses, las comprobaciones de movimiento usan la edad corregida (contada desde la fecha prevista de parto), como recomiendan las guías pediátricas para los bebés prematuros."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与儿科对早产宝宝的做法一致，24 个月前的动作检查使用矫正年龄（从预产期算起）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
