    "This matters most. Keep the head, both hands and both feet inside the picture the whole time, with a little room around them. What the camera can’t see can’t be measured." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This matters most. Keep the head, both hands and both feet inside the picture the whole time, with a little room around them. What the camera can’t see can’t be measured."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es lo más importante. Mantén la cabeza, las dos manos y los dos pies dentro de la imagen todo el tiempo, con un poco de espacio alrededor. Lo que la cámara no ve no se puede medir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一点最重要。请让头、两只手和两只脚始终都在画面内，四周再留一点空。相机看不到的动作，就量不出来。"
          }
        }
      }
