    "Videos analysed earlier with YOLO are treated as new and analysed again with InstantHMR automatically. Videos made with other InstantHMR settings keep their results until you analyse them again. Notes, dates and milestones are kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Videos analysed earlier with YOLO are treated as new and analysed again with InstantHMR automatically. Videos made with other InstantHMR settings keep their results until you analyse them again. Notes, dates and milestones are kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los videos analizados antes con YOLO se tratan como nuevos y se analizan de nuevo con InstantHMR automáticamente. Los videos hechos con otros ajustes de InstantHMR conservan sus resultados hasta que los analices de nuevo. Las notas, fechas e hitos se conservan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之前用 YOLO 分析的视频会被当作新视频，自动用 InstantHMR 重新分析。用其他 InstantHMR 设置分析的视频会保留结果，直到你重新分析。备注、日期和里程碑都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
